<!-- Soạn (spec mục 8.2): port đủ chức năng của bản Svelte (Soan.svelte, QuestionEditor.svelte) theo bố cục thẻ và tab của bản mới.
     Thẻ "Đặt câu vào" chọn chỗ (môn, chương, bài) dùng chung cho bốn tab: Tạo câu, Nhập, Xuất, Prompt cho AI.
     Logic ở Core: Transfer (tạo, nhập, xuất gói), AuthorForm (dựng câu), Prompts. -->
<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:l="clr-namespace:BKStudyDesk.Desktop.Lang"
             x:Class="BKStudyDesk.Desktop.Views.Practice.AuthorView">
    <StackPanel Spacing="24">
        <DockPanel>
            <Button DockPanel.Dock="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top" Content="{l:T practice.back}" Click="OnBack" />
            <StackPanel Spacing="2">
                <TextBlock Classes="title" Text="{l:T practice.author.title}" />
                <TextBlock Classes="meta" Text="{l:T practice.author.meta}" />
            </StackPanel>
        </DockPanel>

        <Border Classes="card">
            <StackPanel>
                <Border Classes="card-head"><TextBlock Classes="card-title" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="{l:T practice.author.where}" /></Border>
                <StackPanel Margin="16" Spacing="12">
                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,12,*,12,*" RowDefinitions="Auto,4,Auto">
                        <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.course}" />
                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.unit}" />
                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.lesson}" />
                        <ComboBox x:Name="CourseBox" Grid.Row="2" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" SelectionChanged="OnCourse" />
                        <ComboBox x:Name="UnitBox" Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="2" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" SelectionChanged="OnUnit" />
                        <ComboBox x:Name="LessonBox" Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="4" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" SelectionChanged="OnLesson" />
                    </Grid>
                    <StackPanel Spacing="4">
                        <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.author}" />
                        <TextBox x:Name="AuthorBox" MaxWidth="320" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Width="320" LostFocus="OnAuthorLost" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="FlashText" Classes="sub" TextWrapping="Wrap" IsVisible="False" />
                    <TextBlock x:Name="NoCourseText" Classes="sub" TextWrapping="Wrap" IsVisible="False" Text="{l:T practice.author.noCourse}" />
                </StackPanel>
            </StackPanel>
        </Border>

        <TabControl x:Name="Tabs" Padding="0">
            <TabItem Header="{l:T practice.author.tab.create}">
                <Grid x:Name="CreateColumns" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="2*" MinWidth="{StaticResource MainMinWidth}" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="24" />
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" MinWidth="{StaticResource SideMinWidth}" MaxWidth="{StaticResource SideMaxWidth}" />
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <StackPanel Spacing="24">
                        <!-- Câu hỏi mới (khi đã chọn bài) -->
                        <Border x:Name="QuestionCard" Classes="card">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <Border Classes="card-head"><TextBlock x:Name="QuestionHead" Classes="card-title" VerticalAlignment="Center" /></Border>
                                <StackPanel Margin="16" Spacing="12">
                                    <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.type}" />
                                    <WrapPanel x:Name="Types" />
                                    <TextBox x:Name="TagBox" PlaceholderText="{l:T practice.author.tag}" />
                                    <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.question}" />
                                    <TextBox x:Name="PromptBox" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap" MinHeight="96" TextChanged="OnFormText" />
                                    <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.hint}" />
                                    <StackPanel x:Name="OptionsPanel" Spacing="8">
                                        <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.options}" />
                                        <StackPanel x:Name="OptionRows" Spacing="8" />
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="16">
                                            <Button x:Name="AddOptionButton" Content="{l:T practice.author.addOption}" Click="OnAddOption" />
                                            <CheckBox x:Name="KeepOrderBox" Content="{l:T practice.author.keepOrder}" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <CheckBox x:Name="TruthBox" Content="{l:T practice.author.truth}" IsChecked="True" IsCheckedChanged="OnFormCheck" />
                                    <Grid x:Name="NumericPanel" ColumnDefinitions="*,12,*,12,*" RowDefinitions="Auto,4,Auto">
                                        <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.value}" />
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.tolerance}" />
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.unitField}" />
                                        <TextBox x:Name="ValueBox" Grid.Row="2" TextChanged="OnFormText" />
                                        <TextBox x:Name="ToleranceBox" Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="2" />
                                        <TextBox x:Name="UnitBoxText" Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="4" />
                                    </Grid>
                                    <StackPanel x:Name="ShortPanel" Spacing="4">
                                        <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.accept}" />
                                        <TextBox x:Name="AcceptBox" TextChanged="OnFormText" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.solution}" />
                                    <TextBox x:Name="SolutionBox" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap" MinHeight="72" TextChanged="OnFormText" />
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="CreateError" Classes="danger" TextWrapping="Wrap" IsVisible="False" />
                                    <Button x:Name="SaveButton" Classes="accent" Content="{l:T practice.author.save}" Click="OnSave" />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <Border x:Name="MineCard" Classes="card">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <Border Classes="card-head"><TextBlock Classes="card-title" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="{l:T practice.author.mine}" /></Border>
                                <StackPanel x:Name="MineRows" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <!-- Bài mới (khi chưa chọn bài) -->
                        <Border x:Name="LessonCard" Classes="card">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <Border Classes="card-head"><TextBlock Classes="card-title" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="{l:T practice.author.newLesson}" /></Border>
                                <StackPanel Margin="16" Spacing="12">
                                    <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.err.noLesson}" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                    <StackPanel x:Name="NewUnitPanel" Spacing="4">
                                        <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.newUnit}" />
                                        <TextBox x:Name="NewUnitBox" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="4">
                                        <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.lessonName}" />
                                        <TextBox x:Name="NewLessonBox" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="4">
                                        <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.body}" />
                                        <TextBox x:Name="BodyBox" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap" MinHeight="96" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="LessonError" Classes="danger" TextWrapping="Wrap" IsVisible="False" />
                                    <Button Classes="accent" Content="{l:T practice.author.createLesson}" Click="OnCreateLesson" />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <Border x:Name="PreviewCard" Grid.Column="2" Classes="card" VerticalAlignment="Top">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <Border Classes="card-head"><TextBlock Classes="card-title" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="{l:T practice.author.preview}" /></Border>
                            <StackPanel x:Name="Preview" Margin="16" Spacing="12" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                </Grid>
            </TabItem>

            <TabItem Header="{l:T practice.author.tab.import}">
                <Border Classes="card" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <Border Classes="card-head"><DockPanel>
                            <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Classes="meta" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="{l:T practice.author.import.formats}" />
                            <TextBlock x:Name="ImportHead" Classes="card-title" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                        </DockPanel></Border>
                        <StackPanel Margin="16" Spacing="12">
                            <TextBox x:Name="RawBox" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap" MinHeight="160" MaxHeight="400" FontFamily="{StaticResource CodeFont}"
                                     PlaceholderText="{l:T practice.author.import.paste}" TextChanged="OnRawChanged" />
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                <Button Content="{l:T practice.author.import.pick}" Click="OnPickFile" />
                                <Button x:Name="ImportButton" Classes="accent" Content="{l:T practice.author.import.go}" Click="OnImport" />
                            </StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="ImportTitle" Classes="name" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                            <TextBlock x:Name="ImportNotes" Classes="sub" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </TabItem>

            <TabItem Header="{l:T practice.author.tab.export}">
                <Border Classes="card" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <Border Classes="card-head"><TextBlock x:Name="ExportHead" Classes="card-title" VerticalAlignment="Center" /></Border>
                        <StackPanel Margin="16" Spacing="12">
                            <TextBlock x:Name="ExportStats" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                            <TextBlock x:Name="ExportErrors" Classes="danger" TextWrapping="Wrap" IsVisible="False" />
                            <WrapPanel ItemSpacing="8" LineSpacing="8">
                                <Button x:Name="ExportMdButton" Classes="accent" Content="{l:T practice.author.export.md}" Click="OnExportMd" />
                                <Button x:Name="ExportCopyButton" Content="{l:T practice.author.export.copy}" Click="OnExportCopy" />
                                <Button x:Name="ExportXmlButton" Content="{l:T practice.author.export.xml}" Click="OnExportXml" />
                                <Button x:Name="ExportGiftButton" Content="{l:T practice.author.export.gift}" Click="OnExportGift" />
                                <Button x:Name="ExportJsonButton" Content="{l:T practice.author.export.json}" Click="OnExportJson" />
                            </WrapPanel>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="ExportDone" Classes="sub" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                            <TextBlock Classes="sub" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="{l:T practice.author.export.hint}" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </TabItem>

            <TabItem Header="{l:T practice.author.tab.prompt}">
                <Border Classes="card" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <Border Classes="card-head"><TextBlock x:Name="PromptHead" Classes="card-title" VerticalAlignment="Center" /></Border>
                        <StackPanel Margin="16" Spacing="12">
                            <WrapPanel x:Name="Modes" />
                            <StackPanel x:Name="PickPanel" Spacing="4">
                                <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.prompt.pick}" />
                                <ComboBox x:Name="PickBox" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" SelectionChanged="OnPickChanged" />
                            </StackPanel>
                            <Grid x:Name="CountPanel" ColumnDefinitions="Auto,12,*" RowDefinitions="Auto,4,Auto">
                                <TextBlock Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.prompt.count}" />
                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Classes="sub" Text="{l:T practice.author.prompt.extra}" />
                                <NumericUpDown x:Name="CountBox" Grid.Row="2" Minimum="1" Maximum="40" Value="10" Increment="1" FormatString="0" Width="140" ValueChanged="OnCount" />
                                <TextBox x:Name="ExtraBox" Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="2" TextChanged="OnExtraText" />
                            </Grid>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="StepsText" Classes="sub" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                            <TextBox x:Name="PromptText" IsReadOnly="True" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap" MinHeight="200" MaxHeight="400" FontFamily="{StaticResource CodeFont}" />
                            <Button x:Name="CopyPromptButton" Classes="accent" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Content="{l:T practice.author.prompt.copy}" Click="OnCopyPrompt" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </TabItem>
        </TabControl>
    </StackPanel>
</UserControl>
